<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田駅外ノーマル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Well then, take care. Be sure to get in touch now and then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... Sorry, </STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, it's what <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> decided. 
{PAUSE ""}
But is this all right? You didn't tell those two when you were leaving, did you?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I guess they'll be angry, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"More than angry, you'll make them worry, I'd say. 
{PAUSE ""}
They kept trying to stop you, didn't they?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... cried her eyes out at me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">That girl</STYLE> was always worrying about <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, I'll get going."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right, be careful."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
